    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautifully presented family home within close proximity of the coast.\r\n\r\nWarren Estates are delighted to bring this most delightful family home to the market. Located in the Ballinatray area of Courtown, ‘Kinvara’ offers all the tranquillity of country living, whilst still being less than 5 minutes from the sea, Gorey town and the motorway.\r\n\r\nThis contemporary and airy bungalow extends to approximately 107m2 (1,151ft2) and boasts light filled, well-appointed living accommodation throughout. ‘Kinvara’ offers three double bedrooms (one with shower room ensuite), a cosy sitting room, family bathroom and an open plan kitchen/dining area with wonderful views across to Tara Hill. There is also a utility room and store located off the en-suite which has access to a large integral garage. This garage could easily be converted into additional living/sleeping space subject to the necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is set back from the road with private parking. The front garden is bordered by mature trees and given its southernly orientation, acts a sheltered suntrap to enjoy all day sunshine. There is a low maintenance rear garden which offers wonderful views across the surrounding area across to Tara Hill.    \r\n\r\nThis property presents a most wonderful opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented family home with all the benefits of country living, whilst still being within minutes from all local amenities including primary and secondary schools, shops, pubs, cafes, golf courses, forest walks, bus and rail links to Dublin, soccer, GAA and rugby clubs, supermarkets, hotels and a host of sandy beaches."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance porch\t\t\r\nTiled floor, panelled ceiling, recessed lighting.\r\nHallway\t\t\r\nTiled floor.\r\nSitting room\t                      3.8m x 4.3m\r\nFeature fireplace, tiled floor. \r\nKitchen\t                   6.5m x 2.9m\r\nRange of wall and floor units, integrated oven, gas hob, extractor fan, plumbed for dishwasher, partially tiled walls, tiled floor, recessed lighting, doors to rear. \r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.8m x 1.9m\r\nWalk-in rainfall shower, WC, WHB, fully tiled, panelled ceiling with recessed lighting.\r\nPrimary bedroom \t\t3.2m x 2.9m.\r\nEnsuite\t\t\t3m x 2.4m\r\nDouble vanity unit, tiled walk-in shower, WC, tiled walls.\r\nBedroom 2\t\t\t3m x 3.5m\r\nBedroom 3\t\t\t4.3m x 3.5m\r\nRear hall\t                         1m x 2.8m\r\nStorage closet.\r\nUtility room\t                         2m x 1.7m\r\nPlumbed for washing machine."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tAll mains \r\n•\tOil fired central heating\r\n•\tLarge integral block-built garage (4.2m x 6.8m)\r\n•\tPrivate parking\r\n•\tSouth-facing front\r\n•\tMature trees and shrubs\r\n•\tWalking distance to village amenities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
