      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Take the R741 for Ballycanew.  Travel for c. 2km and turn left opposite ‘Carraig View’ B & B for Courtown. Continue for about 2km and go through crossroads. Continue 1km beyond crossroads, follow road around to the left and the property is the 4th on the right-hand side.  Eircode Y25 X292"
      },
